{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297800","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297800","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1029780001:0":{"text":"嘿嘿，只要倒点这个，再稍微加一点水，这一瓶就能兑出三瓶……","source_cn":"嘿嘿，只要倒点这个，再稍微加一点水，这一瓶就能兑出三瓶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x945CF1D740D2C060","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029780002:1":{"text":"阿熏！你又在偷工减料！就不怕带坏蒙蒙吗！","source_cn":"阿熏！你又在偷工减料！就不怕带坏蒙蒙吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59296DF3AAF4A1C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029780003:1":{"text":"说什么呢，这是必备的生活技巧——哎呀，是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>和两位使魔呀。","source_cn":"说什么呢，这是必备的生活技巧——哎呀，是<style=...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF60050A25DF50D5A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"说什么呢，这是必备的生活技巧——哎呀，是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>和两位使魔呀。","female":"说什么呢，这是必备的生活技巧——哎呀，是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>和两位使魔呀。","variant_male_record_index":"103190","variant_female_record_index":"103191","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029780004:1":{"text":"是来购物吗？要不要香水？还是药剂？什么药效的都有——","source_cn":"是来购物吗？要不要香水？还是药剂？什么药效的都有——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F1AB7D6A1A33B79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029780005:1":{"text":"这样吧，给各位多打一折，再送瓶赠品，刚刚的事就当做没看见——","source_cn":"这样吧，给各位多打一折，再送瓶赠品，刚刚的事就当做没看见——",